\viewkind4\uc1\pard\sa160\sl252\slmult1\i\f0\fs22 Library Manager Josh Murray announced that a consultant has been retained to conduct a library needs assessment for the community. He invited the public to attend one of the upcoming information-gathering sessions, including: a Senior Focus Group at the Joslyn Community Center on June 23, 2025, at 10:00 AM and a General Focus Group at the Manhattan Beach Library meeting room on June 25, 2025, at 6:30 PM. Teen Focus Groups will be held in the library board meeting room on June 26, 2025, and July 14, 2025, at 4:00 PM. He also reminded the community that the library will be closed on June 19, 2025, in observance of the Juneteenth holiday, and responded to questions from the City Council.\line\line\pard Communications and Civic Engagement Manager Alexandria Latragna announced that a Juneteenth Ceremony will be held at Bruce\rquote s Beach Park on June 19, 2025, from 10:00 AM - 11:00 AM; an artist talk with Keith Magruder at Manhattan Beach Art Center on June 20, 2025 from 7-8 PM; and a Juneteenth Concert will take place at Polliwog Park on June 22, 2025, from 2:00 PM - 7:00 PM.\cf1\i0\f1\par
